  "prefLabel": "Alc 405.03 Eligibility to Provide Clinical Supervision to a LADC",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 405.03 Eligibility to Provide Clinical Supervision to a LADC. Individuals eligible to provide clinical supervision to LADCs or candidate for LADC shall be:\n\n(a) MLADCs who have had at least one year of post-licensure experience in the active practice of substance use counseling;\n\n(b) LADCs who have had at least 2 years of post-licensure experience in the active practice of substance use counseling;\n\n(c) Licensed clinical supervisors; and\n\n(d) Individuals, not licensed by this chapter, approved for supervision pursuant to Alc 407.\n\nSource. #12548, eff 7-1-18; ss by #14045, eff 10-7-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
}
